    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ann_semantic",
      "x": 180,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "From email metadata alone, the compiler can reconstruct\nmulti-year career arcs -- tracing transitions across\nteams, roles, and projects without any explicit input.\nKnowledge doesn't just grow -- it compounds.",
