      "id": "ann_curiosity",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 1770,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "ACTIVE: Compiler spots gaps via gemma4,\nwrites requests to raw/requests/,\nfollow-requests piggyback deep-scans emails.",
      "originalText": "The system tells you what it wants to know\nnext. Like a curious mind, it identifies gaps\nand requests deeper exploration.",
